(footprint "Inductor_Coilcraft_XGL4020"
	(version 20260206)
	(generator "pcbnew")
	(generator_version "10.0")
	(layer "F.Cu")
	(descr "Coilcraft XGL4020 shielded power inductor, body 4.0 x 4.0 x 2.10 mm max. Pads are the recommended land pattern from Coilcraft doc 1529 (XGL4020 datasheet, rev 02/19/26): 0.98 x 3.4 mm on 2.37 mm centres. Fitted part is XGL4020-332MEC (3.3 uH). Taken from the SnapEDA IND_XFL4020-222MEC pattern, whose pad size and 2.37 mm spacing are identical to the XGL4020 recommendation - the two Coilcraft 4020 families share the land pattern. PIN 1 IS THE MARKED TERMINAL: it is the start (short) lead, and Coilcraft specifies connecting the high dv/dt node there for lowest EMI, so pin 1 must go to the regulator SW node and pin 2 to the 3V3 output.")
	(tags "inductor coilcraft xgl4020 xfl4020 shielded power 4020")
